OL,3,GNEWSAPM says second Scottish
OL,4,Aindependence referendum remains 'off
OL,5,Alimits'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has told John Swinney that
OL,8,Fa second Scottish independence
OL,9,Freferendum remains "off limits" after
OL,10,Fspeculation that he had softened his
OL,11,Fstance on the issue.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, the prime minister told
OL,14,FMPs that both in Scotland and Northern
OL,15,FIreland a border poll would be
OL,16,Fconsidered if there was a clear
OL,17,Fconsensus and public opinion had
OL,18,Fchanged.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
