OL,3,GNEWSAPM says second Scottish
OL,4,Aindependence referendum remains 'off
OL,5,Alimits'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThat prompted Scotland's first minister
OL,8,Fto write to him, asking for a meeting
OL,9,Fto discuss how such a mechanism could
OL,10,Fbe enshrined in law.
OL,12,FBut in his reply, Burnham said no
OL,13,Fconsensus currently existed and he
OL,14,Frepeated his view that another
OL,15,Freferendum was off limits while he
OL,16,Ffocuses on growing the economy and cost
OL,17,Fof living pressures.
